WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Metsi a pula a theoha marulelong a kena ka korobong.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Letlowa le tshwara makgasi mme le dumella metsi ho feta.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Metsi a pele a na le lerole la marulelo. A tlatsa phaephe e emeng.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Bolo e a phahama e kwala phaephe. Metsi a latelang a kena tankeng e kwetsweng.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Ha tanka e tletse, metsi a kgaphatsehang a ya sekotlong sa sefate, hole le lebota.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Ha pula e fetile, tsholla metsi a ka phaepeng hore e lokele pula e latelang.
